ins the struggle led by Baron Virril and discovers the fate of the Joons he left behind. [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]</p><h2>Sources</h2><p>Based on the original game dialogue and world descriptions. Source numbers refer to the scenes listed below.</p><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>#</th><th>Sources</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>World description · Jigran (allod jigran)</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a> (briefing brief_254)</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/baron\">Baron Virril</a> (briefing brief_304)</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/junofil\">Tui-Len</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a> (briefing brief_341)</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/firez\">Firez</a> (briefing brief_349)</td></tr></table><h2>Inhabitants</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Related page</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/baron\">Baron Virril</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/bson\">Dartas</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/firez\">Firez</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/nekro\">Jaminin</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/stark\">Master Stark</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/first\">Recruiter</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/deva\">Tai-Ilara</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/junofil\">Tui-Len</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/doctor\">Uncle Rad</a></td></tr></table><h2>Locations</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Related page</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/bz31j\">City of Dar-Leanos</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz31j\">Dar-Leanos and its surroundings</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz33j\">Dar-Ulgorn fortress</a></td></t